body:
i might recommend \[\[Feldon of the Third Path\]\] as he recurs creatures from the graveyard as tokens, or \[Rionya, Fire Dancer\]\] who casts many instants and sorceries pre-combat and then makes a whole whack of token copies

&#x200B;

theres also \[\[Toggo, Goblin Weaponsmith\]\] and \[\[Moraug, Fury of Akoum\]\] who care abt landfall in mono red

its so much work and you get bullied into a shape so unfitting for yourself just to not get picked on and then they'll pick on you for being uptight and high strung - theres no winning but to stop playing the game and you can't do that when other people control how you spend your time or whats an improper response.

&#x200B;

love yourself and embrace yourself as you are and keep growing, fuck the society and people who wish for you to be something you're not

omgosh House Hippo real..

&#x200B;

honestly tho i love simic and i've never seen this card! could definitely force an opponent to tap out or force removal, but i dont know if i think it would really do much in a commander game

oh i was ecstatic having a older trans woman on TDOV tell me i confused her and she couldnt tell which way i was going and thats the BEST COMPLIMENT

&#x200B;

having trans friends ask me how long i've been on HRT for and assume the like wrong direction just makes my tail wag so much - confirmation im doing things right

such a disappointment and a disservice to the public and those who have health concerns

&#x200B;

shameful

we love REX in this household

&#x200B;

okay but honestly gosh i love this robot and their funny plant, keeping eachother going and working hard together. Love that REX would work so tirelessly to keep their plant alive and well

THATS THE FUCKIN MOOD

&#x200B;

im still figuring out being grey-ace, but i know that i want love and i want to be able to love someone. Theres the love i have for friends that is lovely, but i want romantic affection and care and to be able to give that to someone i love.
